<title>USA: Rottlund Co Q4 March 31 loss after charge.</title>
<headline>Rottlund Co Q4 March 31 loss after charge.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenues				$38,074,000     $37,773,000</p>
<p> Net income(loss)			(668,000)	 1,171,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share			 (0.11)		0.21</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1997 Q4 loss includes a non-cash pre-tax writedown of $1.5 million from an inventory valuation adjustment of certain land for about 250 unsold housing units located in Orlando, Fla. and Indianapolis, Ind.  </p>
<p>						 Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>							March 31,</p>
<p>						    1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenues				180,457,000     131,583,000</p>
<p> Net income				1,236,000	 4,242,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share			   0.22		0.74</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1997 year net includes a non-cash pre-tax writedown of $1.5 million from an inventory valuation adjustment of certain land for about 250 unsold housing units located in Orlando, Fla. and Indianapolis, Ind. The writedown of land was required by a new accounting standard.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
